	"tips": "・Japanese spouse visa is for **spouses, children, and special adopted children** of Japanese nationals\n\n・Allows **unrestricted work activities** including employment and business operations, with permanent residency eligibility\n\n・**Proof of genuine marriage** is crucial, requiring evidence of relationship history, photos, and communication records\n\n・**Document requirements vary** by marriage timing, nationality, and marital history\n\n・Check latest requirements at the [Immigration Services Agency](https://www.moj.go.jp/isa/)\n\n> ⚠️ **Important:** Sham marriages and fraudulent applications are serious crimes. Always provide truthful information",
